    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n27692" root="ظمى" body-key="Z">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَظْمِىٌّ</span></b>  Land, (M,) or [rather] seed-produce
(<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَرْع</span>), (S, K,) <i>watered only by the rain:</i> (S, M,
K:) and so <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَظْمِئِىٌّ</span>: (K in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ظمأ</span>:) such as is
irrigated by running water is termed <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَسْقَوِىٌّ</span>. (S.)

